# Client secrets of the sign-in providers (Google, Microsoft, Zoho) go in this
# directory, one file each: google-client-secret, microsoft-client-secret,
# zoho-client-secret. `idp-provision` reads them through a read-only mount.
# See "Sign in with Google, Microsoft or Zoho" in deploy/README.md.
# Never commit them.
*
!.gitignore
